      {
        "h_title": "What to Expect",
        "main_title": "Full Moon Party",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Once the sun goes down, Haad Rin Beach transforms into a pulsating playground of music, lights, and energy. The beach fills with sound systems, each playing different music styles—from commercial hits and EDM to reggae, drum and bass, and techno.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Multiple stages with international and local DJs.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Fire shows, performances, and games involving fire that you can participate!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "UV body paint stations.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Food stalls and beach bars.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "A massive beach-wide dance floor under the moonlight.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "And with the recent legalization of cannabis in Thailand, you will find countless number of weed shops lining up the streets of town.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "As of the time of this writing, the party is officially permitted to run till sunrise (6:00 am).",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "You will find:",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "The Experience",
        "main_title": "Full Moon Party",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The Full Moon Party goes beyond just a night of dancing, it's an unforgettable cultural experience that brings together people from all backgrounds. The vibe is electric, and dancing under the full moon creates a unique sense of community.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "While the party has become more commercial over the years, it still keeps elements of its free-spirited roots, making it a must-do experience for travelers looking for both fun and cultural immersion.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
